			"notes": "- Improved crafting requests: when one query matches multiple items, the chat now asks you to choose with clickable buttons.\n- Fixed craft selection flow: clicking a choice now shows the exact recipe and removes the temporary selection message.\n- Added a dedicated craft-query mode so recipe lookups are more predictable.\n- Added an automatic hint in craft-related AI replies about the dedicated craft-query mode.\n- Updated the help output to include the new craft-query workflow.\n- Client-side features now work even on vanilla servers, with automatic server-side AI fallback when available.\n- Update checking now posts a clean in-chat link directly to the exact release source."
